    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><strong>&quot;My Father's House&quot;</strong> is a survival horror game set in an old family mansion, located in the hills near a cemetery in New England, becomes a real nightmare for Michael West, a writer who set out to learn more about his roots and the secrets of the past.<br>Upon arriving at his family's house, Michael unravels secrets long forgotten. Hidden basements, secret passageways, and a forbidden laboratory point to experiments conducted by his father, opening doors to a world of the undead. And now Michael must survive, try to understand the situation and find a way out of this nightmare.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Atmosphere of Horror:</i> Explore the ominous mansion and its surrounding areas, full of mystery and secrets.<br></li><li><i>Survival Mechanics:</i> Use limited resources wisely to survive among dangerous creatures.<br></li><li><i>Combat System:</i> Use firearms sparingly while trying to conserve limited ammo.<br></li><li><i>Stealth Gameplay:</i> Hide, use shadows, and move silently to avoid enemies.<br></li><li><i>Puzzles:</i> Solve a variety of puzzles to access new areas of the house and uncover the storyline.<br></li><li><i>Roguelike Elements:</i> Item placements and resources may vary with each new game start, adding variability and challenge.</li></ul><br>In &quot;My Father's House,&quot; you'll dive into a story that takes you through the dark corridors of the past and the terrifying realities of the present. How far are you willing to dive to uncover all the secrets?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><strong>&quot;My Father's House&quot;</strong> is a survival horror game set in an old family mansion, located in the hills near a cemetery in New England, becomes a real nightmare for Michael West, a writer who set out to learn more about his roots and the secrets of the past.<br>Upon arriving at his family's house, Michael unravels secrets long forgotten. Hidden basements, secret passageways, and a forbidden laboratory point to experiments conducted by his father, opening doors to a world of the undead. And now Michael must survive, try to understand the situation and find a way out of this nightmare.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Atmosphere of Horror:</i> Explore the ominous mansion and its surrounding areas, full of mystery and secrets.<br></li><li><i>Survival Mechanics:</i> Use limited resources wisely to survive among dangerous creatures.<br></li><li><i>Combat System:</i> Use firearms sparingly while trying to conserve limited ammo.<br></li><li><i>Stealth Gameplay:</i> Hide, use shadows, and move silently to avoid enemies.<br></li><li><i>Puzzles:</i> Solve a variety of puzzles to access new areas of the house and uncover the storyline.<br></li><li><i>Roguelike Elements:</i> Item placements and resources may vary with each new game start, adding variability and challenge.</li></ul><br>In &quot;My Father's House,&quot; you'll dive into a story that takes you through the dark corridors of the past and the terrifying realities of the present. How far are you willing to dive to uncover all the secrets?",
